)
(text "Four ИН-12А share the cathode bus K0-K9 and the two ИН-17 their own bus KS0-KS9; every tube has its own anode line. The display board carries nothing\nbut tubes, lamps, LEDs and the strips."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 19.05 0)
